    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "When you're done with a draft and don't want it lingering, delete it from File → Delete. markoto asks you to type the doc's title back as a confirmation, strong friction by design, because deletion is permanent. The text, its history, its comments and every image in it are removed, and anyone who has the doc open is sent back to their dashboard.",
